.claude/plans/PLAN-169/repass-rc1-20260908-NOGO/verdict-rc1-1.txt:3:- P1 — `scripts/upgrade.sh:2885` — Concrete failure: the merge walks the entire current template and appends every absent registration. A v1.3.0 maintainer who deliberately removed `check_canonical_edit.py`, `check_bash_safety.py`, or another existing hook gets it silently re-armed. Lines 2903–2904 likewise restore deliberately removed `.env` keys. This contradicts the help’s “new lifecycle hooks” claim at `scripts/upgrade.sh:393`. Minimal fix: derive only registrations/settings introduced since the installed version; if that baseline is unavailable, withhold them unless an explicit repair option is supplied.
