.claude/plans/PLAN-169/repass-rc1-20260908-NOGO/verdict-rc1-5.txt:24:   Concrete failure: `os.path.isfile()` and `open()` both follow a symlinked `PLAN-NNN/LEDGER.md`. An adopter’s ledger symlink can therefore make PreCompact read up to 64 KiB outside the repository and copy external Markdown headings into the continuity snapshot.
