.claude/plans/PLAN-194/repass-rc1/verdict-rc1-2.txt:3:- **Condition 3 is honest.** At [audit_log.py:1275](.claude/hooks/audit_log.py#L1275), predecessor read, HMAC calculation, append and sidecar update share one lock. Rotation emits the marker before reading the predecessor. Lock timeout drops the event with a breadcrumb. This cures the stated condition-67 case.
